<title>EGYPT: Central Mills Q3 96/7 pre-tax $11.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Central Mills Q3 96/7 pre-tax $11.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of the financial year 1996/7, which began on July 1, 1996 and ends on June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available)</p>
<p>					  July 96-March 97</p>
<p> Net sales				450,939,481</p>
<p> Production costs		     404,677,745</p>
<p> Overheads				 15,315,665</p>
<p> Exceptional revenues		  11,021,039</p>
<p> Exceptional expenditure		2,726,339</p>
<p> Net profit before tax		 39,240,771</p>
<p>Full company name is Central Egypt Flour Mills.</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
